# Comparison against another value, equality, membership and a boolean condition.
If the value "stored hash" is not the value "current hash", the module "decision" changes the record "target".
If the value "name" is in the set "done", the module "executor" skips the record "target".
If the value "name" is not in the set "done", the module "executor" launches the process "shell".
The thread "executor" is bounded by the value "jobs".
The field "floors" is at most the field "max floors".
If the value "dry run" is true, the module "cli" prints "plan".
If the value "dry run" is false, the module "cli" launches the process "shell".
If the value "code" is 0, the module "commands" returns the value "success".
If the value "code" is not 0, the module "commands" raises the error "MinimakeError".
The value "mode" is the value "default".
The key-value store "Store" is not keyed by the value "hour".
The module "m" is not implemented in "legacy/**".
